{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57592","headline":"玉皇授歘生大洞三十九章与登龙台歌二章 一 · 无名氏","name":"玉皇授歘生大洞三十九章与登龙台歌二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飈飈三霞领，徊刚七元盖。\n八景入太元，飞洒九天外。\n琼扉生景云，灵烟絶幽蔼。\n西宫咏洞玄，清唱扶桑际。\n守雌森峯间，玄吟五老会。\n歘生有心哉，与尔结中带。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}